{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54078","headline":"苏州寒食日送人归觐 · 李频","name":"苏州寒食日送人归觐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江声寒食下，花木惨离魂。\n几宿投山寺，孤帆过海门。\n篷声泼火雨，柳色禁烟村。\n定看堂高後，斑衣灭泪痕。\n（见《择是居丛书》影宋绍定二年刊本宋范成大《吴郡志》卷四九）（按：《全唐诗》卷五八九录此诗，有缺字，今重录。\n另同卷《即席送许□之曹南省兄》，据《吴郡志》同卷，所缺一字爲「制」字，诗不重录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李频","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54078.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54078","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}